; Regression (R1, 2026-09-19): a function reads no global that can change -- it
; is an input the signature does not name, and a `mutable` global is
; thread-local, so a task on another worker would read a different cell.
; xfail: error: function scaled reads global factor; a function reads no global that can change - pass the value in, or make it a procedure

mutable factor: int 3

function scaled(n: int) returns int
    n * factor

if scaled(2) = 6
    print "PASS\n"
